{
  "id": "the-humming-claim",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "The Humming Claim",
    "premise": "In Tumble Forks, a boomtown built atop veins of magic loud enough to rattle teeth, the trail called the Widow's Grade has swallowed every expedition sent to reopen the mother lode. A dying prospector's last map offers one more reason to try, before the town goes silent for good.",
    "tone": [
      "exploration",
      "whimsical-fey"
    ],
    "tier": "local",
    "partyLevel": 4,
    "narrationVoice": "A wry frontier storyteller, half showman and half ghost-story teller, who lets the magic do the shouting.",
    "contentLimits": {
      "exclude": [
        "harm to children depicted on-screen"
      ],
      "note": "No children appear on-screen in peril; keep NPC minors, if referenced, entirely off-page."
    },
    "provenance": "flint"
  },
  "entry": "tumble-forks-arrival",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "tumble-forks-arrival",
      "kind": "threshold",
      "title": "Tumble Forks",
      "prose": "Tin roofs hum in harmony with the veins beneath them, and every saloon sign chimes when the wind is right. The town is dying of quiet gold and loud losses: the Widow's Grade trail has taken three expeditions this season, including prospector Mabel Thorn, who left only a half-burned map and a promise of a fortune in singing ore.",
      "readAloud": "The street itself seems to breathe a low chord, gold dust glittering in the air like caught music. A crowd has gathered around a chalkboard tally of the missing.",
      "art": "art-the-humming-claim-tumble-forks-street",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "to-guild-hall",
          "label": "Seek the Miners' Guild for backing and information",
          "target": "guild-hall",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "to-cabin",
          "label": "Search Mabel Thorn's abandoned cabin first",
          "target": "prospectors-cabin",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "to-trailhead",
          "label": "Skip the preparations and head straight for the trailhead",
          "target": "trailhead-warning",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "improvBudget": 7,
      "entryWhen": {
        "op": "always"
      },
      "onEntry": [],
      "onExit": [],
      "terminal": false
    },
    {
      "id": "guild-hall",
      "kind": "social",
      "title": "The Miners' Guild",
      "prose": "The guildmaster, a one-eared woman named Ottilie Cask, keeps a jar of ringing nuggets on her desk that hum louder the closer danger draws. She's buried too many friends on the Grade and is desperate enough to help, if you're clever enough to ask right.",
      "art": "art-the-humming-claim-guild-hall-interior",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "to-cabin-from-guild",
          "label": "Thank her and go search the cabin as well",
          "target": "prospectors-cabin",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "to-trailhead-from-guild",
          "label": "Take what she's told you and head for the trailhead",
          "target": "trailhead-warning",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "bribe-supplies",
          "label": "Persuade the quartermaster to part with enchanted rope and rations",
          "target": "trailhead-warning",
          "effects": [
            {
              "flag": "supplies-ready",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "requiresCheck": {
            "ability": "cha",
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "dc": 13,
            "onFailure": "prospectors-cabin"
          }
        }
      ],
      "improvBudget": 7,
      "entryWhen": {
        "op": "always"
      },
      "onEntry": [],
      "onExit": [],
      "terminal": false
    },
    {
      "id": "prospectors-cabin",
      "kind": "discovery",
      "title": "Mabel's Cabin",
      "prose": "The cabin smells of tallow and burnt paper. A journal lies open on the table, its last entries scrawled faster and faster, as if the writer's hand were being pulled by the words themselves.",
      "art": "art-the-humming-claim-cabin-interior-clues",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "read-journal-to-trailhead",
          "label": "Read what's left of the journal and head for the trail",
          "target": "trailhead-warning",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "to-guild-from-cabin",
          "label": "Bring your findings to the Guild hall",
          "target": "guild-hall",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "search-hidden-cache",
          "label": "Search for the hidden cache Mabel's notes hint at",
          "target": "trailhead-warning",
          "effects": [
            {
              "flag": "knows-safe-path",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "requiresCheck": {
            "ability": "wis",
